        "TileImage": "$($repository ee2af034-8ebe-43f8-a8f3-525e060dbb31).Image",
        "Description": "Its Miami again! But this time, we are wanting things to be more long range. Well except one guy, because he may be competition, and that means he thinks he&apos;s special. Well special types get especially blown up!\r\rAnd Alex Moyer has to go again! Not hard too figure out why with that one. Lazy Bum!\r\rFlorida Man has also got to go! And the other two, well they move too much! Yes thats a valid reason.\r\rAnyway, Good Luck!",
